# Five-page product catalog of a furniture workshop. There are two sections: the cover, full
# bleed (Margin: 0), without a page number and without the document footer (Inherit page overlays: false), and the
# body, numbered from 1. It has a product index with their printed pages (a Table of contents, which the
# engine fills with the headings), product cards in a two-column grid with the photo cropped
# (Fit: fill) and a "New" label set diagonally in the corner (an Overlay with Rotate), and a final
# page with woods, orders and contact. The cards are all alike: the style is in styles.stxt and
# only the content changes. The titles of the cover and of the index are a Heading 1 with
# In table of contents: false, so that they do not appear in it. The labels are written in lowercase and the rules
# put them in uppercase (Case).
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 54 50 64 50
	Title: 2026 Catalog · Taller Nogal
	Language: en
	Page overlay:
